**Source:** `/source/old-prompts/<source-filename>.md`
**Date converted:** <YYYY-MM-DD>
**Disposition:** MERGED — absorbed into the `<skill-name>` category skill as `modes/<mode>`
**Destination:** `/ship/skills/<skill-name>/modes/<mode>.md` + related refs/templates

